Error [jet.ImmutableAssignment]: `items` was made with `:`, so it can't be changed
  --> tests/ui/iter_next_immutable_binding.jet:5:11
    |
  5 |     print(items.next())
    |           ^^^^^
 Why: `next: fn(&self)` changes the value it's called on, so `items` must be mutable (`:=`)
 Fix: Declare it with `items := ...`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0111
